ofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">First, what is Pigment should be mentioned higher, maybe even in the T&amp;S write up. Nothing fancy, even &quot;Pigment, drug that let people see Twilight&quot;</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Second, you should made a &quot;sidebar&quot; about what are <b>Wraiths</b>, especially in nWoD cosmology context. How they are diffrent from ghosts? Are they in Underworld? Link to whole subforum is a bit messy.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Third, you probably should not make operatives on Pigment or in PCU units as &quot;ghosts&quot;. With <b>GMC</b> / 2ed rules there are some implications of using ghosts and not spirits, or even neither of them. But very nicely can be made extra &quot;Twilight templates, so maybe do something different, like calling it an Echo? Or just Astral Projection, from <b>Mage</b>?</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">And fourth - you need an Enemy section in write-up. On to what the Orpheus Group hunts? What are they general prey? What do they do with it? Beside ghosts and spirits are vampires, werewolves, mages - or maybe even fae concerned with them?</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Like I said, it was supposed to be used in conjunction with either the nWoD Wraith or Orpheus homebrew I made.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Raistlin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/320752-the-orpheus-group?p=323211#post323211\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There is no mention of what an operative can do while projecting on Twilight, or about his &quot;ghost powers&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>He basically gets the Wraith-template (see link above) without having to remain permanently dead.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>nWoD Warhammer Fantasy RPG,<br /> WoD Wraith: The Oblivion<br /> and Infernum-style Demon: The Descent, Shadows of Abaddon --&gt; <a href=\"http://madnessforums.com/forums/index.php/topic,26.0.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://madnessforums.com/forums/inde...opic,26.0.html</a><br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/974-mrparaduo","name":"MrParaduo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar974_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"967"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-28T16:32:03-08:00","id":324846,"title":"","content":"Does it still play after the sixth maelstrom or could it be as simple as hunters hunting ghosts?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1873-jan-paparazzi","name":"Jan Paparazzi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0