ernatural to me. A Sin-Eater krewe would be my go to set up for them.<br /> <br /> This is still pretty good, just not quite my taste for that organization.<br /> You might want to give people a heads up about projecting along with a few guidelines (if not rules) or at least sign-posts to the books with ideas on how it works.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":1624,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","user":"FallenEco","date":". 12-05-2014, 02:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-05T12:04:41-08:00","id":331370,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/320752-the-orpheus-group?p=331351#post331351\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">T&amp;S feel like hunters but Orpheus/Lazarus always felt more...supernatural to me. A Sin-Eater krewe would be my go to set up for them.<br /> <br /> This is still pretty good, just not quite my taste for that organization.<br /> You might want to give people a heads up about projecting along with a few guidelines (if not rules) or at least sign-posts to the books with ideas on how it works.</div> </div> </div> </div>I left that open to the ST to decide. Again, either you 